  "_readme": "EM-persona draft. Fields marked REPLACE_ME must come from your brief -- everything else is a reasonable default for an Engineering Manager environment across these nine apps. The capability list is the part that matters most: it is what the coverage checker measures the environment against, and what the client report cites as the standard.",

